---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Avtandigital — Support"
  description="Support and contact information for Avtandigital mobile apps: Mafia Anchor, Joker, Undercover, JustSayIt, and ShadowCam."
  active="support"
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <span class="badge">🛟 Avtandigital</span>
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Help, troubleshooting, and contact information for Avtandigital mobile apps.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin: 32px 0 40px;">
    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      Have a question, found a bug, or want to request a feature? Email us directly and we'll get back to you as soon as we can — usually within a few days.
    </p>
    <a class="pill-link primary" href="mailto:avtukalaz@gmail.com">📧 avtukalaz@gmail.com</a>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>Apps</h2>
    <ul class="apps">
      <li class="card app-card">
        <h3>Mafia Anchor</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A fun party-style game for Android users.</li>
          <li>No account or sign-in is required — nothing to reset or recover.</li>
          <li>In-game coins are stored locally on your device. Reinstalling the app resets your coin balance.</li>
          <li>If rewarded ads won't load, check your internet connection and try again in a few minutes — ad availability can vary by region and network.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="app-links">
          <a class="pill-link" href="/Mafia-Anchor/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy →</a>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="card app-card">
        <h3>Joker</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A casual card-game scoresheet designed for a fun and simple experience.</li>
          <li>No account or sign-in is required — nothing to reset or recover.</li>
          <li>Your in-progress game autosaves locally, so closing the app won't lose your scores.</li>
          <li>Points used to start new games are stored locally on your device and reset if you reinstall the app.</li>
          <li>EEA/UK/Switzerland users can review or change ad consent anytime via the "Ad Privacy Settings" button on the main screen.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="app-links">
          <a class="pill-link" href="/Joker/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy →</a>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="card app-card">
        <h3>Undercover</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A local, offline, pass-and-play party game.</li>
          <li>Works entirely offline — no account, ads, or internet connection required.</li>
          <li>Player names, photos, word decks, and game progress are stored only on your device.</li>
          <li>Camera access is only used if you choose to add a player photo, and can be granted or revoked anytime in your device settings.</li>
          <li>To clear all app data, uninstall the app or use your device's "Clear storage" option for the app.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="app-links">
          <a class="pill-link" href="/Undercover/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy →</a>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="card app-card">
        <h3>JustSayIt</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A pass-and-play ice-breaker party game — draw a card, answer or take the penalty.</li>
          <li>No account or sign-in is required — nothing to reset or recover.</li>
          <li>The question bank ships inside the app, so gameplay itself needs no internet connection.</li>
          <li>Coins are earned by watching rewarded ads and spent starting a game session; your balance is stored locally and resets if you reinstall the app.</li>
          <li>The "Extreme" category is 18+ and unlocks after a one-time age confirmation, which is remembered on your device.</li>
          <li>EEA/UK/Switzerland users can review or change ad consent anytime via the "Privacy Options" link in the main menu.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="app-links">
          <a class="pill-link" href="/JustSayIt/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy →</a>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="card app-card">
        <h3>ShadowCam</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Background video recording with on-device encryption — recordings never leave your phone.</li>
          <li>No account or sign-in is required — there is no server and nothing is uploaded.</li>
          <li>Notification permission is required, not optional: Android mandates a visible indicator while the camera runs in the background, and that notification is also how you stop a recording.</li>
          <li>Recording, playback, and deleting all work offline. Saving a decrypted copy to your gallery costs one rewarded ad, which needs an internet connection.</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion is permanent.</strong> The encryption key lives in your device's secure hardware and is never backed up, so uninstalling the app or resetting the phone destroys every recording with no recovery path.</li>
          <li>Recording people without their knowledge is illegal in many places — complying with the law where you are is your responsibility.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="app-links">
          <a class="pill-link" href="/ShadowCam/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy →</a>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <dl class="faq">
      <dt>How do I delete my data?</dt>
      <dd>None of our apps require an account, so there's no server-side data to delete. All app data lives on your device — uninstalling the app or clearing its storage from your device settings removes everything. For ShadowCam this is irreversible: its encryption key can't leave your device, so uninstalling destroys every recording permanently.</dd>

      <dt>An ad won't load — is something wrong?</dt>
      <dd>Ads are served by Google AdMob and depend on your internet connection and ad availability in your region. Try again in a few minutes, or check that you're connected to the internet.</dd>

      <dt>I found a bug. How do I report it?</dt>
      <dd>Email us at <a href="mailto:avtukalaz@gmail.com">avtukalaz@gmail.com</a> with your device model, OS version, and the app version if possible, along with steps to reproduce the issue.</dd>

      <dt>Can I request a new feature?</dt>
      <dd>Yes — we're happy to hear suggestions. Send them to <a href="mailto:avtukalaz@gmail.com">avtukalaz@gmail.com</a>.</dd>

      <dt>Do these apps work offline?</dt>
      <dd>Undercover works fully offline. Mafia Anchor, Joker, and JustSayIt work offline for gameplay, but need an internet connection to show rewarded ads. ShadowCam records, plays back, and deletes offline — only saving a copy to your gallery needs a connection, since it's gated behind a rewarded ad.</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>
</Layout>
